message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. Please also cite the
  AIOMFAC publications listed at https://aiomfac.lab.mcgill.ca/citation.html
  (this package is a validated pure-Python port of their Fortran model), and,
  for aiomfac_py.s2as, Amaladhasan et al. (2026),
  https://doi.org/10.5194/gmd-19-4601-2026.
title: "aiomfac_py: a pure-Python port of the AIOMFAC thermodynamic activity-coefficient model"
